---
// OWNER REVIEW NEEDED: this notice is a plain-language draft, not legal advice.
// Updated 18 November 2026 for the candidate and employer forms and CV uploads, and 20 November 2026 for the
// optional phone numbers and the revised candidate form. Lomolink Consulting must check it before launch, in particular:
//   - how long candidate details and CVs are kept (consider stating a fixed period, e.g. 12 months)
//   - mailbox retention and hosting logs
// then set `reviewed` to true to remove the draft notice from the page.
const reviewed = true;
const lastUpdated = '20 November 2026';

import Container from '../components/Container.astro';
import PageHeader from '../components/PageHeader.astro';
import { routes } from '../data/routes';
import { site } from '../data/site';
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const h2 = 'mt-12 font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-navy lg:text-[28px]';
const h3 = 'mt-6 font-semibold text-navy';
const list = 'mt-3 list-disc space-y-2 pl-6 marker:text-gold';
const link = 'font-semibold text-teal underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-navy';
---

<BaseLayout title={`Privacy Notice | ${site.name}`} description="How Lomolink Consulting handles the information you send through the forms on this website, including candidate details and CVs.">
	<PageHeader eyebrow="Your information" title="Privacy Notice">
		<p class="mt-4 text-white/80">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>
	</PageHeader>

	<section class="py-12 lg:py-20">
		<Container>
			<div class="max-w-3xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-dark-grey">
				{!reviewed && (
					<p class="mb-10 rounded-xl border border-gold bg-cream p-5 text-base">
						<strong class="text-navy">Draft:</strong> this notice is awaiting review by {site.name} and may change before it is finalised.
					</p>
				)}

				<p>This notice explains what information we collect through this website, why we collect it and what we do with it. We have written it in plain language. If anything is unclear, please contact us.</p>

				<h2 class={h2}>Who we are</h2>
				<p class="mt-4">This website is run by {site.name}. You can contact us about this notice or your information:</p>
				<ul class="mt-4 space-y-2">
					<li>Contact: {site.contactPerson}</li>
					<li>Email: <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`} class={link}>{site.email}</a></li>
					<li>Telephone: <a href={site.phoneHref} class={link}>{site.phone}</a></li>
					<li>Address: {site.address.join(', ')}</li>
				</ul>

				<h2 class={h2}>What we collect</h2>
				<p class="mt-4">This website only collects what you choose to send us through one of its three forms.</p>
				<h3 class={h3}><a href={routes.contact} class={link}>Contact form</a></h3>
				<ul class={list}>
					<li>your name, email address and message</li>
					<li>your phone number, if you give one</li>
				</ul>
				<h3 class={h3}><a href={routes.recruitmentRegister} class={link}>Candidate registration</a> (health and social care roles)</h3>
				<ul class={list}>
					<li>your full name and email address, and your phone number if you give one</li>
					<li>your town or postcode, and the areas you can travel to for work if you tell us</li>
					<li>your preferred role</li>
					<li>for domiciliary care roles, whether you have a full UK driving licence and access to a car for work</li>
					<li>whether you are new to care or have care experience, and any experience and relevant training you choose to describe</li>
					<li>whether you are looking for full-time or part-time work, your preferred shifts and your earliest start date if you give one</li>
					<li>your CV, if you choose to upload one</li>
					<li>your agreement that we may share your details and CV with employers about suitable roles</li>
				</ul>
				<h3 class={h3}><a href={routes.recruitmentEmployers} class={link}>Employer enquiry</a></h3>
				<ul class={list}>
					<li>your organisation’s name, a contact name and email address, and a phone number if you give one</li>
					<li>the role, location, shift pattern and essential requirements</li>
				</ul>
				<p class="mt-4">Please do not send sensitive details we do not need, such as your date of birth, health information, or ID or right-to-work documents. If a specific vacancy needs identity documents or references, we will ask for them later. If you are contacting us on behalf of someone else, please make sure they have agreed before you share their information.</p>

				<h2 class={h2}>How we use it</h2>
				<ul class={list}>
					<li><strong class="text-navy">Contact form:</strong> only to read and reply to your enquiry.</li>
					<li><strong class="text-navy">Employer enquiries:</strong> only to discuss your staffing needs and look for suitable candidates.</li>
					<li><strong class="text-navy">Candidate registrations:</strong> to understand what roles may suit you, to contact you about suitable opportunities and, with your agreement, to share your details and CV with employers about those roles.</li>
				</ul>
				<p class="mt-4">You can withdraw your agreement to share your details with employers at any time by emailing <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`} class={link}>{site.email}</a>. We will then stop sharing them. This does not affect anything already shared before you told us.</p>
				<p class="mt-4">We do not sell your information and we do not share it with anyone for marketing.</p>

				<h2 class={h2}>Your CV</h2>
				<p class="mt-4">Uploading a CV is optional. The website accepts only PDF and Word (.docx) files up to 5 MB and checks each file before accepting it. Your CV is attached to the email sent to our company mailbox. It is not saved on the website.</p>

				<h2 class={h2}>Where it goes and how long we keep it</h2>
				<p class="mt-4">When you send a form, your details are emailed straight to our company mailbox. The website itself does not save them.</p>
				<p class="mt-4">Contact and employer enquiries are kept in our mailbox in line with our own email retention practices and deleted when they are no longer needed. Candidate details and CVs are kept only while we are helping you look for a suitable role. We delete them when they are no longer needed, or sooner if you ask us to.</p>

				<h2 class={h2}>Protecting the forms from spam</h2>
				<p class="mt-4">To stop the forms being misused, the website keeps a short-lived record that counts how many forms have been sent from the same internet connection. This record does not contain your IP address itself, only a scrambled code (a keyed hash) made from it, and it does not contain anything you wrote or uploaded. Records older than one hour are no longer used and are deleted automatically.</p>

				<h2 class={h2}>Cookies and tracking</h2>
				<p class="mt-4">This website does not set cookies. It does not use analytics, advertising or tracking tools, and it does not load content from other websites.</p>
				<p class="mt-4">Like most websites, our hosting provider may keep standard technical logs (such as IP addresses and the pages requested) to run and protect its servers.</p>

				<h2 class={h2}>Your rights</h2>
				<p class="mt-4">You can ask us for a copy of the information we hold about you, ask us to correct it, ask us to delete it, or withdraw your agreement to share it with employers. To do this, email <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`} class={link}>{site.email}</a>. We will respond as soon as we can.</p>
				<p class="mt-4">If you are unhappy with how we have handled your information, please contact us first so we can try to help. You also have the right to complain to the Information Commissioner’s Office (ICO), the UK data protection regulator, at <a href="https://ico.org.uk" class={link}>ico.org.uk</a>.</p>

				<h2 class={h2}>Changes to this notice</h2>
				<p class="mt-4">We may update this notice from time to time. The date at the top shows when it was last changed.</p>
			</div>
		</Container>
	</section>
</BaseLayout>
